    "title": "Revised State Budget Could Impact IE Families - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By sbamericannews ,\n1 days ago Riverside, CA, May 26th, 2026 – Feeding America Riverside | San Bernardino (FARSB) is grateful that Governor Newsom included $38 million of CalFood funding in the new state budget; however, the local food bank worries that it is not enough to address hunger as a whole within the Inland Empire (IE) and beyond. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
